WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.600
Would you put this in front of an investor?

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:12.000
Not if you cannot say where any of it came from.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Every number opens like this.

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
The page, the exact sentence, and the minute it was read.

5
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.400
Ten seconds to check one. So you can hand the whole thing to somebody else.

6
00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:38.400
Every page it read, listed.

7
00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:46.400
Including one it was not allowed to read.

8
00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:52.400
It still gives you the link. A person can open what a program cannot.

9
00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:56.400
Nothing it found is withheld from you.

10
00:00:56.400 --> 00:01:00.400
Asking it questions is next.
